{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tale of android after the Apocalypse",
    "steam_appid": 3387320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity, had somehow lost her memory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together with Naive, her integrated support AI, she sets out to explore her lost memories,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the mystery of her activation, and the mystery of humanity's extinction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While battling mysterious figures who suddenly appear and attacking androids, what truth will she uncover?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[What kind of game?]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a devastated world to unravel lost memories and the mystery of humanity's demise in this <u><strong>exploration adventure RPG</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by the support AI Naive, you'll search for the truth while battling mysterious entities that suddenly appear and androids that attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/b4bf9e217a7de3c8c1ee3719e2106444.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game that blends orthodox <u><strong>command-based RPGs</strong></u> with <u><strong>mystery adventure</strong></u> games where you issue instructions via commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds from a visual novel-like perspective, with battles and exploration progressing seamlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[System]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's viewpoint is that of the support AI, Naive. Issue commands to Niluas and advance the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative, composed of 5 chapters, features a <u><strong>multi-ending system with Endings A, B, and C</strong></u>, changing the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, a side story unlocks after full completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Exploration &amp; Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely move across the field to solve mysteries and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring, you may find rare items or hints to solve the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/7de88a321391173d3bc04a6744d01b3f.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving around triggers random encounter battles with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize skills and more to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/fd8a12e7970a4f7375ac8f723f030982.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you'll experience story-driven battles where battle commands change according to enemy characteristics,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or Niluas might hide behind objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Voice Actors]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character voices are provided by a luxurious lineup of VAs: <strong><u>Reina Shiratori</u></strong> as the protagonist android, Niluas, and <strong><u>Saki Asagi</u></strong> as the mysterious being, Unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note that it features partially voiced rather than full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/e87ae14cb37169865e5fddc6f409fccc.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/1fd735c2f1963c905e6e59f3259f101b.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/3f2ca7f2cdfa883fe384740e11630ced.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/dc1a0be99202366202d5f1040d117c3a.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Planning and Development]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Moko App.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Music]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u9b54\u738b\u9b42(maou-damashii)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Confidential Document A10277</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Command]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the guidance of a support AI, players utilize commands to solve mysteries and unravel tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Combat]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When moving between locations, players may encounter enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player's level is lower than the enemy's, they will be subjected to a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must engage in combat using normal attacks and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Skills]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usable skills in combat include the Gravity Cannon and Repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are powerful, but require &quot;Skill Disks&quot; to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Skill Disks&quot; are not easily obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also skills that don't require Skill Disks but they are difficult to handle, so its sealed them away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Level]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can level up by achieving victories in combat against enemies, based on the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The benefit of leveling up is an increase in HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's level is higher than the enemy's, they can launch a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Equipment]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids do not require traditional equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a modification chip is found, it is automatically installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modification chips are rare and difficult to obtain, but they might be lying around somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Androids]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids are sentient mechanical lifeforms with self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are bipedal and designed to resemble humans.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity, had somehow lost her memory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together with Naive, her integrated support AI, she sets out to explore her lost memories,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the mystery of her activation, and the mystery of humanity's extinction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While battling mysterious figures who suddenly appear and attacking androids, what truth will she uncover?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[What kind of game?]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a devastated world to unravel lost memories and the mystery of humanity's demise in this <u><strong>exploration adventure RPG</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by the support AI Naive, you'll search for the truth while battling mysterious entities that suddenly appear and androids that attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/b4bf9e217a7de3c8c1ee3719e2106444.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game that blends orthodox <u><strong>command-based RPGs</strong></u> with <u><strong>mystery adventure</strong></u> games where you issue instructions via commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds from a visual novel-like perspective, with battles and exploration progressing seamlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[System]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's viewpoint is that of the support AI, Naive. Issue commands to Niluas and advance the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative, composed of 5 chapters, features a <u><strong>multi-ending system with Endings A, B, and C</strong></u>, changing the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, a side story unlocks after full completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Exploration &amp; Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely move across the field to solve mysteries and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring, you may find rare items or hints to solve the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/7de88a321391173d3bc04a6744d01b3f.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving around triggers random encounter battles with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize skills and more to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/fd8a12e7970a4f7375ac8f723f030982.avif?t=1754737797\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you'll experience story-driven battles where battle commands change according to enemy characteristics,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or Niluas might hide behind objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Voice Actors]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character voices are provided by a luxurious lineup of VAs: <strong><u>Reina Shiratori</u></strong> as the protagonist android, Niluas, and <strong><u>Saki Asagi</u></strong> as the mysterious being, Unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note that it features partially voiced rather than full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/e87ae14cb37169865e5fddc6f409fccc.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/1fd735c2f1963c905e6e59f3259f101b.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/3f2ca7f2cdfa883fe384740e11630ced.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387320/extras/dc1a0be99202366202d5f1040d117c3a.avif?t=1754737797\" data-has-big width=1600 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Planning and Development]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Moko App.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Music]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u9b54\u738b\u9b42(maou-damashii)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Confidential Document A10277</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Command]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the guidance of a support AI, players utilize commands to solve mysteries and unravel tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Combat]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When moving between locations, players may encounter enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player's level is lower than the enemy's, they will be subjected to a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must engage in combat using normal attacks and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Skills]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usable skills in combat include the Gravity Cannon and Repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are powerful, but require &quot;Skill Disks&quot; to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Skill Disks&quot; are not easily obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also skills that don't require Skill Disks but they are difficult to handle, so its sealed them away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Level]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can level up by achieving victories in combat against enemies, based on the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The benefit of leveling up is an increase in HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's level is higher than the enemy's, they can launch a preemptive attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Equipment]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids do not require traditional equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a modification chip is found, it is automatically installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modification chips are rare and difficult to obtain, but they might be lying around somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Androids]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Androids are sentient mechanical lifeforms with self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are bipedal and designed to resemble humans.</p>",
    "short_description": "Niluas, an android who suddenly activated 276 years after the extinction of humanity. With her AI, Naive, she seeks lost memories, her activation's mystery, and humanity's extinction's cause. Facing enigmatic foes and hostile androids, she quests for truth about her existence and the desolate world.",
